tyle="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:5pt"><span><br/></span></div><div id="i7db8f0f7553c44ebbd251472e9d01f6a_55"></div><div style="margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:8pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTE 8 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:GoodwillAndIntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="f-514" continuedAt="f-514-1" escape="true">GOODWILL</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="f-514-1"><div style="margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the three months ended June&#160;30, 2026, we performed a qualitative assessment of goodwill and determined that a triggering event had not occurred. While an impairment assessment is performed annually in the fourth quarter, the Company monitors its business environment for potential triggering events on a quarterly basis. There is potential for further impairment charges being recognized in future periods based on these ongoing assessments.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">13</span></div></div></div><div id="i7db8f0f7553c44ebbd251472e9d01f6a_58"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:54pt;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">SPOK HOLDINGS, INC.</span></div><div style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">UNAUDITED NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS &#8212; (Continued)</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div></div><div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:10pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">NOTE 9 - <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:AssetRetirementObligationDisclosureTextBlock" id="f-515" continuedAt="f-515-1" escape="true">ASSET RETIREMENT OBLIGATIONS</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:continuation id="f-515-1"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfChangeInAssetRetirementObligationTableTextBlock" id="f-516" escape="true"><div style="margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The components of the changes in the asset retirement obligation liabilities were:</span></div><div style="margin-top:5pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:42.233%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.494%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:17.094%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.494%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:17.094%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.494%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:17.097%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">(Dollars in thousands)</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Short-Term<br/>Portion</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padd